Significance: patch
Type: fix

Restore two payment token query contracts changed unreleased in #66607: get_tokens() honors an explicit limit of 0 again (returns no rows, so extensions returning 0 from woocommerce_get_customer_payment_tokens_limit hide saved methods), and a page argument passed without a limit paginates by a default page size of 100 instead of being ignored, so paginating consumers looping until an empty page terminate.
